rators. 2. Component Repair Services: This division focuses on the restoration and mending of engine parts and accessories. It serves clients in commercial aerospace, military and helicopter sectors, land-based and marine applications, and the oil and gas industry.","description_en":"StandardAero, Inc., founded in 1911 and based in Scottsdale, Arizona, offers specialized post-sale support for aircraft engines. The company provides these services for both fixed-wing and rotary-wing aircraft across a broad international scope, including North America (United States, Canada), Europe (United Kingdom, rest of Europe), Asia, and other global markets. Its operations are organized into two primary divisions: 1. Engine Services: This segment delivers a comprehensive suite of engine after-sales solutions. These include routine maintenance, complex repairs, complete overhauls, in-situ and on-location field support, asset oversight, and various engineering-related provisions. Its customer base spans the commercial aviation industry, military and helicopter fleets, and corporate jet operators. 2. Component Repair Services: This division focuses on the restoration and mending of engine parts and accessories. It serves clients in commercial aerospace, military and helicopter sectors, land-based and marine applications, and the oil and gas industry.","description_zh":"StandardAero, Inc.（美股代碼：SARO）為 Industrials 領域之重要企業，專注於 Aerospace & Defense 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"6710 North Scottsdale Road","city":"Scottsdale","state":"AZ","zip":"85253","country":"US","phone":"480-377-3100","full_address":"6710 North Scottsdale Road, Scottsdale, AZ 85253, US","range_52w":"19.56-34.48","year_high":34.48,"year_low":19.56,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":19.56,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-16","name":"Kaplan Michael L.","title":"officer: Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"M-Exempt","shares":2941,"price":